---
component: hearthFire
params:
  flare: { enum: [low, high] }
---

## The fire

<match subject="@flare">
  <when is="high">
    ::vfx{type="emberBurst"}
    ::sfx{sound="fire roar"}
    @narrator{code="0010"}: The Hearth fire leaps up the flue as if something had fed it.
  </when>
  <when is="low">
    ::sfx{sound="fire crackle"}
    @narrator{code="0020"}: The Hearth fire settles, low and patient.
  </when>
</match>
